: spr1_check_arm64: AArch64 checker of Sporos bytecode — independent second check of stage 1 (Root A is bootstrap/roots/sporos/sporos-stage1.hex).
:
: Exit status: 0 when the file decodes and passes Sporos.checkProg; 5 when
: malformed or ill-typed; 6 when memory is refused or a stack height reaches
: 2^48; 3 when the three redundant passes all disagree. Every non-zero status
: is at Hamming distance >= 2 from 0.
:
: Structure (ELF load address 0x400000 + file offset, PC-relative ADRP BSS):
:   start   (0x40b888)  mmap 64 KiB, read stdin growing with mremap,
:                        triplicate into two more mappings; descriptors
:                        (base, N) at 0x600000, 0x601000, 0x602000; init
:                        x19 = x20 = x21 = REJECT.
:   tripled (0x401100)  pass 1 (x19), pass 2 (x20), pass 3 (x21).
:                        Zero stack/x18 writes, zero stores or syscalls;
:                        writes only own result register (ACCEPT/REJECT/OVERFLOW).
:   vote    (0x4076c8)  canonical 44-byte TMRVoterArm64 (x19,x20,x21),
:                        park b +0 (0x14000000) -> b +0x10 (0x14000004 to guard).
:   guard   (0x4076f4)  dual independent checks of x19==ACCEPT and
:                        x20==ACCEPT before exit((x20 - 0x96) mod 256).
:
: Every instruction decodes via AArch64Phys.decodeWord (4-byte fixed width),
: no svc #0 or Hamming-1 neighbour of svc #0 occurs outside real syscalls.
:
: Total 47636 bytes.

